---
import '../../styles/decision.css';
---

<section id="decision" class="decision-section section-pad">
  <div class="container split-grid">
    <div class="section-copy">
      <p class="label muted">The real decision</p>
      <h2>A marksheet is not a career map.</h2>
      <p>
        Marks can show exam preparation, but they do not fully show how a child handles pressure, solves problems,
        communicates, or stays interested in a subject over time.
      </p>
      <p>
        The costly mistake is choosing a stream only because the child scored well once, friends are choosing it, or
        a coaching class made the path sound automatic.
      </p>
    </div>
    <figure class="image-card image-card-small">
      <picture>
        <source srcset="/images/parent.webp" type="image/webp" />
        <img src="/images/parent.jpg" alt="Parent and child reviewing study choices together" loading="lazy" width="800" height="598" />
      </picture>
      <figcaption>Guidance before the pressure of stream selection peaks.</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>
